ne/godot/pull/121716.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121716.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Problem\r\nCan't multi select errors in the debugger as stated in this [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15197).\r\n\r\n### The fix <3\r\n\r\n- Enabled standard Ctrl/Cmd click, shift click multi selection in debugger -> Errors.\r\n- Adds ctrl/cmd + a and ctrl/cmd + c\r\n- Copies complete error details and stack traces in tree order.\r\n- Moves source navigation to double click so normal selection does not unexpectedly open scripts.\r\n\r\nAlso it synchronizez selection across the timestamp and message columns so the entire row is highlighted just a small thing.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/424fabcc-6f55-4b54-ae87-33ec3ae1874e\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15197","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121716/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121716/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}